  "notes": "Per child on the other-dependent roster. 0 when the box is no or when lost to the tie-breaker. Blocks when the child tax credit box is also yes, when another test fails, or when the child passes every credit test (use the credit box). Otherwise 1 with an SSN valid for employment or, without one, an ITIN or ATIN by the due date.",
